    "reviews": "\u201cThis series is a legit masterpiece. I am literally thinking about it all day long waiting for the next part to come out. This is how all visual novels should be done. A long, winding story full of twists and turns, where you don't have the characters tell you about their pasts, but actually live it all with them in real time month after month. I'm actually speeding through the sex scenes just to find out what's going to happen next. It's not just one secret you're trying to figure out, but a whole web of intrigue. And the introduction of the villain who was right there under your nose my God, chefs kiss! I don't know if this was just trying to be a Ghost/Soap fan game in the beginning, but it became so much more in its own right. Let's have more long-form series! This is how you do visual novels right!\u201d<br />\r\nPatreon Patron<br />\r\n",
